OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOccasional
OL,6,Fshowers this evening, some heavy with
OL,7,Fchance of thunder. Still a few showers
OL,8,Finto the early hours but becoming
OL,9,Fmainly dry later with some clear
OL,10,Fintervals.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA mainly dry start with a
OL,13,Ffew sunny intervals then cloud
OL,14,Fincreasing to bring a few showers from
OL,15,Flate morning.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,18,Fdry, quite cloudy but some sunny
OL,19,Fintervals. Saturday dry with some
OL,20,Fsunshine. Sunday mainly cloudy perhaps
OL,21,Fsome patchy light rain.
